<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3286] Run All Paragraphs stops if there is a disabled paragraph mid-run</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3286</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Run All Paragraphs runs fine until it reaches a disabled paragraph in the middle of a run.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;How it should be processed: disabled paragraphs should be just skipped; following paragraphs should be processed normally.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;What happens: disabled paragraph doesn&apos;t run (as expected), but it doesn&apos;t run non-disabled paragraphs after that as well (this is the bug).&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also it seems make Zeppelin not able to run any paragraphs at all (even manually).. it&apos;s in some stuck state (refreshing page fixes this state).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
